<title>SPAIN: Spain January PPI fell 0.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Spain January PPI fell 0.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Statistics Institute gave the following figures:</p>
<p> PRODUCER PRICES		    JAN 97     DEC 96     JAN 96</p>
<p> Pct change on month		-0.1	  0.1	  0.9</p>
<p> Pct change on year		  0.8	  1.8	  3.7</p>
<p>The INE gave the following breakdown (percentage change)</p>
<p>					   JAN 97   DEC 96   JAN 97/96</p>
<p> Energy				   -1.4     0.4	 4.5</p>
<p> Non-energy minerals, chemicals   -0.1     0.4	-1.6</p>
<p> Metals, precision tools	     0.4     0.0	 1.9</p>
<p> Other manufacturing		   0.0     0.0	 0.1</p>
<p> Consumer goods			  0.0     0.1	 1.4</p>
<p> Capital goods			   0.4     0.0	 1.7</p>
<p> Intermediary goods		   -0.3     0.3	-0.2</p>
<p>NOTE: Previous month's figures show monthly variation.</p>
</text>
